{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ca37637feb19ddff08e0cae7c64e15f07776e308f739d03422e047130a1f3d6", "ja": "（『おとぎの国の物語』、今日の撮影が終わった。\n響の姿が見えないようだが……？）", "zh": "（《童话王国的故事》今日的拍摄工作结束了。\n似乎没看到响的身影……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "bd4306c33fe32d4c77a0cdb8edf66a7408a6fbb4bc2b63999b7b5a59bf2da566", "ja": "ふぅ。\nもう、みんないなくなったかな……？", "zh": "呼，\n大家应该都走了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "23476667b81e971a4819773f3ed2538357e386e072845ac3c080afc8b8ad25f5", "ja": "あ、いたいた。おーい、響ー！", "zh": "啊，找到了。喂──响──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "7bfae5e0598b026a285314f48aaec128cf38f70e170b8643e8d6d2958f43ec3a", "ja": "うぎゃー！？　って、{$P$}か……\nもう、びっくりさせないでよね！", "zh": "呜呀──！？啊，是{$P$}啊……\n真是的，不要吓本人啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f20043e235d3c7c309beac17a7106cc45c4591490f6261b70c2682725dde7cb2", "ja": "ごめん、そんなに驚くとは思わなくて。\nそれより、そんなところで何してるんだ？", "zh": "抱歉，我没想到你会那么惊讶。\n先不说这个，你在那里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "3e32fda479719c0647830d6b7158a2f86226bf8ac49ef18673dc5b3adffd95b8", "ja": "シーッ！　隠れてるの！\n{$P$}、星梨花たちは？　いない？", "zh": "嘘──！本人正在躲着！\n{$P$}，星梨花她们呢？不在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a16c805eb73c39cbb22909ef1ee31dd099801e25490d85ed34426b2704cc6cbf", "ja": "みんなは、先に帰ったけど……。\nどうしたんだ？　ケンカでもしたのか？", "zh": "大家都先回去了……\n怎么了？你们吵架了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "f89a5c14d0ced04d28ed6b9f96cb827f212ce9e69cba4c33dafeed2c1b91d219", "ja": "ケンカなんかしてないぞ！　今回の撮影が始まってから\n自分たち、前よりもっと仲良くなったからね！", "zh": "才没有吵架！自从这次的拍摄工作开始后，\n我们变得比之前更要好啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "147dc51455247e7a3eb5876511e73d60b09f7158ef08e86eabcadedb67bd9db4", "ja": "でも、自分がビッキーの衣装を着てると、\n星梨花たちが……。", "zh": "可是，只要本人穿着毕奇的服装，\n星梨花她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "37f80ee1d406765a1e8453718cec208706a3d71e31e771eb1a4859726ed84eea", "ja": "すぐに、頭を撫でようとしてくるんだ！\n自分、先輩なのにひどいと思わない！？", "zh": "会动不动就想要摸本人的头！\n本人明明是前辈，你不觉得这样很过分吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a3fa43b9599fa1132d74d2579be6f0686800af002ec16d771c2d8f7fc5f5e1ba", "ja": "ははっ、そうだったのか。でも、その衣装だし……\nみんなが撫でたくなる気持ちもわかるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是这样啊。不过，毕竟你穿着那身服装嘛……\n我也能明白为什么大家会想摸你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "8e426bd956d2f1c0c1e7bc72eb607b79716be52433c179a194a7fc894292003d", "ja": "うう……{$P$}まで……。\n自分は真剣に悩んでるのに……。", "zh": "唔唔……连{$P$}也这样……\n本人可是很认真在烦恼耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9c62341c2c128b9b5c4ce22715ad68d5edf1e6a81b938e381a20c93b02685dca", "ja": "ご、ごめん。\nでも、何がそんなに嫌なんだ？", "zh": "抱、抱歉。\n可是，为什么你会这么讨厌被摸呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "9a9ca2b0176584e9bf06c30e2c44dbee0254711cc872ca8a65edf9793d6e3f5f", "ja": "別に、嫌ってわけじゃないけど……みんなの前で\n頭を撫でられるとか、先輩として威厳がないでしょ！", "zh": "本人并不是讨厌被摸……但是在大家的面前被摸头，\n不就失去了身为前辈的威严吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1014_p", "source_sha256": "717ed6bc751c567696ca33005486c79bd5dc75add9c67c1a07660a400a462a64", "ja": "そんな事ないと思うけどな。響は先輩として、\n撮影でもみんなをちゃんとフォローしてるじゃないか。", "zh": "我认为没有那种事喔。\n你在拍摄时，不是有作为前辈好好地从旁协助了大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1777ad64e95cf9196af1ca954046cacd146f43456152aacf2b9415ca940a539f", "ja": "星梨花達も言ってたよ。響が色々教えてくれるから\n心強いし、毎日撮影が楽しいって。", "zh": "星梨花她们也有说过喔，说因为你会指导她们各种事，\n让她们感到很放心，每天的拍摄都很愉快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "d143265c7df728ab9b2f981010788830f949cab695477a96551d76d6d6ef0ab2", "ja": "え……みんなが？\n{$P$}、それ、本当？", "zh": "咦……大家这么说？\n{$P$}，那是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6289e1c6b92e409f9c8547a84abafb198aa0172ffe3f2588892599475f944000", "ja": "ああ。それに……もしかしたらだけど、星梨花は\n響を撫でて、それで緊張を解してるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊，而且……虽然这只是我的猜测，\n不过星梨花或许是想借由摸你，来缓解她的紧张吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1018_p", "source_sha256": "eb5d2ae9ccdfe8e7081175fc1d33afac37dbd163f7183cc59f6cd102e051377c", "ja": "響だって、家でいぬ美を撫でたらリラックスするだろ？\n星梨花の家には、ジュニオールがいるし……。", "zh": "你在家摸汪美时，也会觉得放松对吧？\n而星梨花家里则是有朱尼奥尔在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "e78bb32a20c1e33b540c6d38c5a64d6d23c13f8ab5b2360ecc9eb2846f3d8acf", "ja": "あっ……そっか。\n星梨花は撮影で緊張してるから、それで……。", "zh": "啊……是这样啊。\n星梨花因为拍摄在紧张，所以才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "bb184748483cc0f0b4c41d91a43240522b5eeeb28ace4be304016af115fe82d0", "ja": "{$P$}！\n自分は、先輩として星梨花に頼られてたんだね！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n本人被星梨花当作前辈依靠了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1e70ea8d0746eebf1bf4513a37ec9eb0ff244c347694e6cdb8e55df6c741d175", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。\n響、ちょっとだけガマンしてあげられるか？", "zh": "或许是那样呢。\n响，你能为了她稍微忍耐一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "26810796677c3b4a1991a5980542ad73c8e458555e169c5772686a66553b2ca6", "ja": "大丈夫！　自分、ガマンなんかしないぞ。明日からは\n先輩として、全力で星梨花に撫でられてあげる！", "zh": "没事的！本人并没有在忍耐喔。\n从明天开始，本人会作为一位前辈，尽全力给她摸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0134_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9488b378f9279244c5d8647decb64be9802ff9a2ffc0aebc071cde8d7a820b1a", "ja": "（響は笑顔で、そう言い切った。そんな響の優しさが、\n何よりも、星梨花の緊張を解きほぐしてくれるだろう）", "zh": "（响带着笑容如此断言。\n或许就是她的这份温柔，为星梨花缓解了紧张吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
